{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimal, elegant footer section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the uploaded reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact design reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different layout. Match the positioning, spacing, proportions, background, contact cards, typography and alignment.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width footer section.
    
    Background: warm ivory cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 45px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 45px.
    
    Minimal, premium, editorial aesthetic.
    
    All main brand content centred.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients, heavy shadows or decorative illustrations.
    
    2. CENTRED BRAND LOGO
    
    At the top centre, display the original Kiss & Kry logo.
    
    Use an editable Shopify image picker.
    
    Preserve the original logo artwork and proportions.
    
    Logo width: approximately 125px.
    
    Height: auto.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Maintain transparent background if available.
    
    Do not recreate or modify the logo using text.
    
    Below the logo, add the tagline:
    
    "Born from bamboo. Made for baby."
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: muted warm grey (#858575).
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Margin-top: 12px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 35px.
    
    3. FOUR CONTACT CARDS
    
    Create exactly FOUR equally sized horizontal contact cards in one row.
    
    Desktop layout:
    
    Four equal-width columns.
    
    Gap: 12px.
    
    Each card approximately 215px wide and 65px tall.
    
    Background: white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Border radius: 15px.
    
    No prominent border.
    
    Very subtle soft shadow.
    
    Internal horizontal padding: 15px.
    
    Vertically centre all content.
    
    Each card must contain:
    
    Circular olive icon background on the left.
    
    Small uppercase category label.
    
    Contact name or number below.
    
    Small diagonal arrow icon at the far right.
    
    CARD 1 – INSTAGRAM
    
    Icon:
    
    Instagram outline SVG.
    
    Circular background: muted olive (#626B4C).
    
    Icon colour: white.
    
    Circle size: 38px.
    
    Label:
    "INSTAGRAM"
    
    Main text:
    "@kissandkry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/
    
    CARD 2 – FACEBOOK
    
    Icon:
    
    Facebook SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "FACEBOOK"
    
    Main text:
    "Kiss & Kry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61563831763161
    
    CARD 3 – WHATSAPP
    
    Icon:
    
    WhatsApp outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "WHATSAPP"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    https://wa.me/919999738480
    
    CARD 4 – CALL US
    
    Icon:
    
    Telephone outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "CALL US"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    tel:+919999738480, CONTACT CARD TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Category label:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    8px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 1.5px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Main contact text:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #555849.
    
    Arrow:
    
    Small northeast arrow.
    
    Colour: #A8AD91.
    
    Size: 12px.
    
    All four cards must have identical dimensions and alignment.
    
    Make each entire card clickable.
    
    4. CENTRED NAVIGATION MENU
    
    Below the four contact cards, create a single horizontally aligned navigation menu.
    
    Display exactly these six links:
    
    Shop
    
    Why bamboo
    
    Our story
    
    Reviews
    
    Care guide
    
    FAQ
    
    Styling:
    
    Horizontal layout.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Gap: 30px.
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    No background.
    
    No borders.
    
    No underline by default.
    
    Subtle colour transition on hover.
    
    Each navigation item must have an editable destination URL.
    
    5. BOTTOM FOOTER BAR
    
    Add a thin horizontal divider below the navigation.
    
    Divider:
    
    Width: 100%.
    
    Height: 1px.
    
    Colour: #E5E0D2.
    
    Margin-top: 35px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 20px.
    
    Create a bottom horizontal row with two aligned sections.
    
    LEFT – COPYRIGHT
    
    Text:
    
    "© 2026 Kiss & Kry. All rights reserved."
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    RIGHT – LEGAL LINKS
    
    Display four links in one horizontal row:
    
    Shipping policy
    
    Returns & refunds
    
    Privacy policy
    
    Terms of service
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Gap: 20px.
    
    Right aligned.
    
    No underline by default.
    
    Hover colour: #626B4C.
    
    Use Shopify's native policy URLs wherever available.
    
    6. EXACT COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use the following colours:
    
    Main background: #F5F3E7
    
    Contact card background: #FFFFFF
    
    Primary olive: #626B4C
    
    Secondary olive: #777D5D
    
    Main text: #555849
    
    Secondary text: #858575
    
    Divider: #E5E0D2
    
    Arrow icon: #A8AD91
    
    Preserve the original Kiss & Kry logo colours:
    
    Burgundy: #7C0504
    
    Terracotta: #93331D
    
    Golden Ochre: #C58C49
    
    Peach Gold: #F1B26D
    
    Do not recolour the uploaded logo.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block; width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }}; padding: 45px 24px; color: #555849;
    font-family: {{ settings.type_body_font.family }}, sans-serif;
  }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} *, .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before, .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 21px; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand { text-align: center; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo { display: block; width: 125px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo-placeholder { width: 125px; height: 70px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo-placeholder svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; color: #858575; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline { margin: 12px 0 35px; color: #858575; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card {
    min-width: 0; height: 65px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; padding: 10px 15px;
    border-radius: 15px; background: #fff; color: #555849; text-align: left; text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 9px rgba(48, 50, 41, .07);
  }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:focus-visible, .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav-link:focus-visible, .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #414832; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { width: 38px; height: 38px; flex: 0 0 38px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: {{ block.settings.icon_background }}; color: #fff; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; display: block; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy { min-width: 0; flex: 1 1 auto; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label { display: block; margin: 0 0 3px; font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #858575; font-weight: 600; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value { display: block; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; color: #555849; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width: 12px; height: 12px; flex: 0 0 12px; color: #A8AD91; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px 30px; margin-top: 30px; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav-link { color: #626B4C; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s ease; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav-link:hover { color: #777D5D; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider { width: 100%; height: 1px; border: 0; margin: 35px 0 20px; background: #E5E0D2; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copyright, .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link { margin: 0; color: #858575; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 20px; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link { text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s ease; }
  .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link:hover { color: #626B4C; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) { .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-left: 45px; padding-right: 45px; } }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: 36px 18px; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { padding: 0; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { padding: 10px; gap: 8px; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex-basis: 34px; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value { font-size: 11px; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav { gap: 12px 22px; margin-top: 26px; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
    .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal { justify-content: center; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 380px) { .ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
{% endstyle %}

<footer class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand">
      {% if block.settings.logo != blank %}
        <img class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo" src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.logo.alt | default: 'Kiss & Kry' | escape }}" width="125" height="{{ 125 | divided_by: block.settings.logo.aspect_ratio | round }}" loading="lazy">
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo-placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline">{{ block.settings.tagline | escape }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards">
      <a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram: {{ block.settings.instagram_value | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy"><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">Instagram</span><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.instagram_value | escape }}</span></span>
        <svg class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5 4h7v7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" href="{{ block.settings.facebook_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook: {{ block.settings.facebook_value | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M13.4 21v-8.2h2.8l.4-3.2h-3.2V7.5c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.7V3.1c-.3 0-1.3-.1-2.5-.1-2.5 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3v2.4H7.2v3.2H10V21h3.4z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy"><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">Facebook</span><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.facebook_value | escape }}</span></span>
        <svg class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5 4h7v7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" href="{{ block.settings.whatsapp_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="WhatsApp: {{ block.settings.whatsapp_value | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.2 11.7a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-12.1 7.2L4 20l1.1-4a8.2 8.2 0 1 1 15.1-4.3Z"/><path d="M9 8.3c.2-.5.4-.5.7-.5h.5c.2 0 .4.1.5.4l.7 1.6c.1.3.1.5-.1.7l-.5.6c-.2.2-.2.4 0 .7.5.8 1.2 1.5 2 1.9.3.2.5.2.7-.1l.7-.8c.2-.2.4-.2.7-.1l1.5.7c.3.1.4.3.4.5 0 .3-.2 1.2-.7 1.5-.5.4-1.2.6-2 .4-1.1-.3-2.5-1-3.7-2.2-1-1-1.8-2.3-2-3.2-.3-1 .1-1.8.6-2.1Z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy"><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">WhatsApp</span><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.whatsapp_value | escape }}</span></span>
        <svg class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5 4h7v7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" href="{{ block.settings.phone_url }}" aria-label="Call us: {{ block.settings.phone_value | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16.5v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 1.1 3.7 2 2 0 0 1 3.1 1.5h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L7 9.4a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.8 2.2Z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy"><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">Call us</span><span class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.phone_value | escape }}</span></span>
        <svg class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12 12 4M5 4h7v7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <nav class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav" aria-label="Footer navigation">
      {% for i in (1..6) %}
        {% assign link_text_key = 'nav_' | append: i | append: '_text' %}
        {% assign link_url_key = 'nav_' | append: i | append: '_url' %}
        <a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav-link" href="{{ block.settings[link_url_key] }}">{{ block.settings[link_text_key] | escape }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </nav>
    <hr class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider">
    <div class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom">
      <p class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copyright">{{ block.settings.copyright | escape }}</p>
      <nav class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal" aria-label="Policies">
        {% if shop.shipping_policy != blank %}<a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link" href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url }}">Shipping policy</a>{% endif %}
        {% if shop.refund_policy != blank %}<a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link" href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">Returns &amp; refunds</a>{% endif %}
        {% if shop.privacy_policy != blank %}<a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link" href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">Privacy policy</a>{% endif %}
        {% if shop.terms_of_service != blank %}<a class="ai-kiss-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__legal-link" href="{{ shop.terms_of_service.url }}">Terms of service</a>{% endif %}
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Kiss & Kry footer",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "logo", "label": "Brand logo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "Tagline", "default": "Born from bamboo. Made for baby." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Background", "default": "#F5F3E7" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "icon_background", "label": "Icon background", "default": "#626B4C" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Instagram" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "instagram_value", "label": "Account", "default": "@kissandkry" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "instagram_url", "label": "Link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Facebook" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "facebook_value", "label": "Account", "default": "Kiss & Kry" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "facebook_url", "label": "Link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "WhatsApp" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "whatsapp_value", "label": "Number", "default": "+91 99997 38480" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "whatsapp_url", "label": "Link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Call us" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "phone_value", "label": "Number", "default": "+91 99997 38480" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "phone_url", "label": "Link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Navigation links" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "nav_1_text", "label": "Link 1 label", "default": "Shop" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "nav_1_url", "label": "Link 1 destination" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "nav_2_text", "label": "Link 2 label", "default": "Why bamboo" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "nav_2_url", "label": "Link 2 destination" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "nav_3_text", "label": "Link 3 label", "default": "Our story" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "nav_3_url", "label": "Link 3 destination" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "nav_4_text", "label": "Link 4 label", "default": "Reviews" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "nav_4_url", "label": "Link 4 destination" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "nav_5_text", "label": "Link 5 label", "default": "Care guide" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "nav_5_url", "label": "Link 5 destination" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "nav_6_text", "label": "Link 6 label", "default": "FAQ" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "nav_6_url", "label": "Link 6 destination" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "copyright", "label": "Copyright text", "default": "© 2026 Kiss & Kry. All rights reserved." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Kiss & Kry footer" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "kiss-kry-footer-block"
}
{% endschema %}